        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-28412-28843"><seg source="#source-28412-28436">こうなると、お</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28436-28457"><rb>嫁合</rb><rt>よめあ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28457-28466">わせを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28466-28478"><rb>恥</rb><rt>は</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28478-28502">ずかしがって、お</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28502-28523"><rb>座敷</rb><rt>ざしき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28523-28526">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28526-28538"><rb>抜</rb><rt>ぬ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28538-28541">け</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28541-28553"><rb>出</rb><rt>だ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28553-28562">すにも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28562-28577"><rb>及</rb><rt>およ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28577-28604">ばなくなりました。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28604-28631"><rb>宰相</rb><rt>さいしょう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28631-28634">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28634-28649"><rb>鉢</rb><rt>はち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28649-28664">かつぎにお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28664-28685"><rb>嫁合</rb><rt>よめあ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28685-28694">わせに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28694-28706"><rb>出</rb><rt>で</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28706-28709">る</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28709-28730"><rb>支度</rb><rt>したく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28730-28745">をさせて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28745-28760"><rb>静</rb><rt>しず</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28760-28766">かに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28766-28778"><rb>待</rb><rt>ま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28778-28799">っていました。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28799-28817"><rb>乳母</rb><rt>うば</rt></